{"id":2213,"date":"2023-09-25T20:50:10","date_gmt":"2023-09-25T19:50:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/?p=2213"},"modified":"2023-09-25T20:50:10","modified_gmt":"2023-09-25T19:50:10","slug":"cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/","title":{"rendered":"Cool stuff in Tableau Public &#8211; September 2023"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hi All,<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Highlighting some more cool visualisations that I have seen over the last couple of months!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Stanley Kin Nok Chan &#8211; &#8220;Scientists That I Like&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Stanley rendered his favourite Scientists in lines using parametric equations in Tableau, and it looks really cool! You can switch between them using the drop down menu. The animations don&#8217;t display on Tableau public, but he has put a link to where you can see them in action.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"887\" data-attachment-id=\"2220\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/notebook\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/notebook.png?fit=849%2C1099&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"849,1099\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"notebook\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/notebook.png?fit=685%2C887&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/notebook.png?resize=685%2C887&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2220\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/stanleykinnok.chan\/viz\/ScientiststhatIlike50000\/notebook\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/stanleykinnok.chan\/viz\/ScientiststhatIlike50000\/notebook<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Brittany Rosenau &#8211; &#8220;Flavor Distribution across 50 Fruit Snack Packs &#8211; Overlay Edition&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This won a #VizOfTheDay shout, and for good reason. Brittany cleverly uses native Tableau features (e.g. annotations) to create different types of Overlays for your dashboard &#8211; useful if you don&#8217;t want to be dipping into other design tools!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"474\" data-attachment-id=\"2222\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/50-fruit-snack-packs-overlay-edition\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/50-fruit-snack-packs-overlay-edition.png?fit=1299%2C899&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1299,899\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"50-fruit-snack-packs-overlay-edition\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/50-fruit-snack-packs-overlay-edition.png?fit=685%2C474&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/50-fruit-snack-packs-overlay-edition.png?resize=685%2C474&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2222\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/brrosenau\/viz\/FlavorDistributionacross50FruitSnackPacks-OverlayEdition\/50FRUITSNACKPACKS-OverlayEdition\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/brrosenau\/viz\/FlavorDistributionacross50FruitSnackPacks-OverlayEdition\/50FRUITSNACKPACKS-OverlayEdition<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Satoshi Ganeko &#8211; &#8220;My precious 500 Vizzes&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Big congratulations to Satoshi Ganeko for hitting 500 vizzes on Tableau public &#8211; and what a fantastic way to show them with this starry spectacular! Check out the download of his workbook for plenty of trigonometry calculations!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"428\" data-attachment-id=\"2225\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/db_main\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/db_main.png?fit=1599%2C999&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1599,999\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"db_main\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/db_main.png?fit=685%2C428&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/db_main.png?resize=685%2C428&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2225\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/satoshi.ganeko\/viz\/Myprecious500Vizzes\/DB_Main\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/satoshi.ganeko\/viz\/Myprecious500Vizzes\/DB_Main<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Zsofia Nika -&#8220;New York Philharmonic: Piano Concertos since 1846&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I love music vizzes, and this one is a cracker &#8211; lovely simple colour palette and some more trigonometry fun!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"685\" data-attachment-id=\"2227\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/nyp-piano-concertos\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/nyp-piano-concertos.png?fit=1399%2C1399&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1399,1399\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"nyp-piano-concertos\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/nyp-piano-concertos.png?fit=685%2C685&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/nyp-piano-concertos.png?resize=685%2C685&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2227\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/zsofia.nika\/viz\/NewYorkPhilharmonicPianoConcertossince1846\/NYPPianoConcertos\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/zsofia.nika\/viz\/NewYorkPhilharmonicPianoConcertossince1846\/NYPPianoConcertos<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Kasia G\u0105siewska-Holc &#8211; &#8220;Custom Chart Builder&#8221; &amp; &#8220;Superstore Comparison Tool&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kasia has produced some great business dashboards recently &#8211; the #VizOfTheDay winning Custom Chart builder and the Superstore Comparison Tool. Both showing really relevant uses of Parameters and Dynamic Zone Visibility particularly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"399\" data-attachment-id=\"2230\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/custom-chart-builder\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/custom-chart-builder.png?fit=1199%2C699&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1199,699\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"custom-chart-builder\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/custom-chart-builder.png?fit=685%2C399&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/custom-chart-builder.png?resize=685%2C399&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2230\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/kasia.gasiewska.holc\/viz\/CustomChartBuilder\/CustomChartBuilder\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/kasia.gasiewska.holc\/viz\/CustomChartBuilder\/CustomChartBuilder<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"474\" data-attachment-id=\"2231\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/superstore-comparison-tool\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/superstore-comparison-tool.png?fit=1299%2C899&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1299,899\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"superstore-comparison-tool\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/superstore-comparison-tool.png?fit=685%2C474&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/superstore-comparison-tool.png?resize=685%2C474&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2231\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/kasia.gasiewska.holc\/viz\/SuperstoreComparisonTool\/SuperstoreComparisonTool\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/kasia.gasiewska.holc\/viz\/SuperstoreComparisonTool\/SuperstoreComparisonTool<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Joris van den Berg &#8211; &#8220;Data Season: a Mobile Magic Dashboard&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I enjoyed this fun one from Joris &#8211; I particularly like the mobile phone styling of it, but also the fun and informative dynamic text that pops up depending on the month chosen!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"516\" data-attachment-id=\"2233\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/home-screen\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/home-screen.png?fit=1564%2C1179&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1564,1179\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"home-screen\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/home-screen.png?fit=685%2C516&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/home-screen.png?resize=685%2C516&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2233\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/joris.van.den.berg\/viz\/DataSeasonaMobileMagicDashboard\/Homescreen\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/joris.van.den.berg\/viz\/DataSeasonaMobileMagicDashboard\/Homescreen<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Lyndsay Betzendahl &#8211; &#8220;Forbes Cloud 100 Impact of Layoffs&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here is a beautiful one from Lyndsay &#8211; and I&#8217;m not going to pretend to know how to build it! This is a very aesthetic looking Voronoi and I love the colours as well. More than anything I like the tagline &#8216;A completely ridiculous chart&#8217;!! \ud83d\ude0a<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"421\" data-attachment-id=\"2235\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/2023\/09\/25\/cool-stuff-in-tableau-public-september-2023\/the-cloud-100-forbes-layoffs\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/the-cloud-100-forbes-layoffs.png?fit=1299%2C799&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1299,799\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"the-cloud-100-forbes-layoffs\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/the-cloud-100-forbes-layoffs.png?fit=685%2C421&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/the-cloud-100-forbes-layoffs.png?resize=685%2C421&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2235\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/lindsay.betzendahl\/viz\/ForbesCloud100ImpactofLayoffs\/TheCloud100ForbesLayoffs\">https:\/\/public.tableau.com\/app\/profile\/lindsay.betzendahl\/viz\/ForbesCloud100ImpactofLayoffs\/TheCloud100ForbesLayoffs<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ant.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A selection of cool vizzes I have come across on Tableau Public &#8211; Sept &#8217;23<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":191258845,"featured_media":2237,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","advanced_seo_description":"","jetpack_seo_html_title":"","jetpack_seo_noindex":false,"jetpack_seo_schema_type":"","_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_publicize_message":"","jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled":true,"jetpack_social_post_already_shared":false,"jetpack_social_options":{"image_generator_settings":{"template":"highway","default_image_id":0,"font":"","enabled":false},"version":2},"jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[54],"tags":[273,50443498,852300],"class_list":["post-2213","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-general","tag-blog","tag-tableau-2","tag-tableau"],"jetpack_publicize_connections":[],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/group-1.png?fit=2699%